    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n2 Bedroom Apartment \n\nDevelopment of 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments, Scholarstown Wood is located in one Dublin's most well established and desirable suburbs and is an exciting development of contemporary designed and energy efficient homes located in the heart of Rathfarnham..\n\n**Parking  Included**\n\nSituated just 8km south of St. Stephen's Green, the area is well served by a number of transport links, with the M50 only a short distance away, providing access to all the main arterial routes to and from the city, including Dublin airport. Rathfarnham benefits from a number of nearby amenities including Marlay Park, St Enda's Park, Dundrum Town Centre and an array of well-known secondary schools.\n\nThe apartments are finished to an extremely high specification, some of these features include:\n High-quality interior finish and bespoke furniture pack\n Floor to ceiling windows\n Modern Appliances\n Integrated Kitchens\n Luxury bathrooms and en-suites\n Separate utility room with separate generous storage..\n Generous balconies / terraces\n Gas heating\n Video intercom\n Underground Parking\n Secure Bicycle storage\n Smart Energy Meters\n High speed internet and complimentary WIFI\n Excellent energy rating A2-A3\n EV charging stations\n- Complimentary assigned parking space\n\nApartments featuring captivating views of the Dublin Mountains.\n\n* Please note, photos may not be specific to this apartment but all apartments are finished to similar standard **\n\n*** Please note there are multiple property types available in this development.\nThe rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types."
